{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_5DD964BD","title":"Fauxter reveals his band split","entry":"Dlg_5DD964BD::entry","exit":"Dlg_5DD964BD::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_2657D505","articyId":"72057774426558659","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Yo buddy. What is HAPPENING!? How is the universe treating you, my noodle-selling, business-running groovy Nivalis friend? How's tricks?","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yo buddy. What is HAPPENING!? How is the universe treating you, my noodle-selling, business-running groovy Nivalis friend? How's tricks?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":-125.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35358","byteOffset":25737816,"byteLength":552}},{"id":"DFr_2BBABFA3","articyId":"72057774426558674","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Hey, I'm really sorry to hear that buddy.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, I'm really sorry to hear that buddy.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20010","byteOffset":15453976,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_EC544284","articyId":"72057774426558696","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Ah... ya know? Not great buddy. Not great AT ALL.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ah... ya know? Not great buddy. Not great AT ALL.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29472","byteOffset":19028352,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_25B94AA9","articyId":"72057774426558712","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"You could say that I'm a guitar without any strings. A drummer with no sticks. A piano with no keys. A flute with no holes. A clavicord with no...","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You could say that I'm a guitar without any strings. A drummer with no sticks. A piano with no keys. A flute with no holes. A clavicord with no...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45983","byteOffset":31728248,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_F46B10AD","articyId":"72057774426558734","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Right! That's me, my friend. Major downer. Hardcore bummer.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Right! That's me, my friend. Major downer. Hardcore bummer.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35689","byteOffset":27849960,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_FDDA10F0","articyId":"72057774426558750","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"The band split.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The band split.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26408","byteOffset":17872560,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_3FD5D858","articyId":"72057774426558772","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Thanks bud.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thanks bud.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3900.0,"y":-125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20318","byteOffset":15570664,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_93C1267C","articyId":"72057774426558779","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Hey, you don't have to be like that.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, you don't have to be like that.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3900.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51456","byteOffset":33882344,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_7E42FE2C","articyId":"72057774426558806","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Where to start? What DIDN'T happen to \"Synapstar Five And The Bionic Jive\"? That was our original band name.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Where to start? What DIDN'T happen to \"Synapstar Five And The Bionic Jive\"? That was our original band name.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":4825.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18747","byteOffset":14978416,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_B651E459","articyId":"72057774426558821","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Well first there were music disagreements. For example, I wanted to make us into an experimental progressive deep house grimecore band...","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well first there were music disagreements. For example, I wanted to make us into an experimental progressive deep house grimecore band...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":5425.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40798","byteOffset":29761264,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_BAD89C34","articyId":"72057774426558843","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"And our bassist thought we should give up music and clean windows.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And our bassist thought we should give up music and clean windows.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":6050.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49462","byteOffset":33054928,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_83FEA597","articyId":"72057774426559222","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Whoa! I'm very happy to hear that good buddy.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Whoa! I'm very happy to hear that good buddy.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":-100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49467","byteOffset":33056864,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_C5DE1837","articyId":"72057774426559254","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Insurmountable.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Insurmountable.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":6650.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32572","byteOffset":20205168,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_1BCC0F13","articyId":"72057774426559268","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Just the usual. Infidelity - I slept with everyone and everyone also slept with everyone. There was a lot of jealousy. Then came the drugs, the alcohol, the groupies.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Just the usual. Infidelity - I slept with everyone and everyone also slept with everyone. There was a lot of jealousy. Then came the drugs, the alcohol, the groupies.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":7250.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30228","byteOffset":19315880,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_FECB8BAD","articyId":"72057774426559283","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"We probably shouldn't have connected with our audience so... directly.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We probably shouldn't have connected with our audience so... directly.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":8150.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48398","byteOffset":32644984,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_6BA87B6A","articyId":"72057774426559296","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"It's just natural, you know! I'm a red blooded man, but I also have a heart too. I need emotional intimacy too. The girls in the crowd - they're a big temptation.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's just natural, you know! I'm a red blooded man, but I also have a heart too. I need emotional intimacy too. The girls in the crowd - they're a big temptation.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":8750.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22117","byteOffset":16252928,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_A71ADB13","articyId":"72057774426559314","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"I guess I just want a non-sexual relationship with many beautiful women. And also a sexual relationship with many beautiful women.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I guess I just want a non-sexual relationship with many beautiful women. And also a sexual relationship with many beautiful women.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":9350.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24257","byteOffset":17053288,"byteLength":512}},{"id":"DFr_14BF4DD2","articyId":"72057774426559327","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"Whatever. Just leave me alone will ya? You're bumming me out. I don't even want to think about this stuff. It's bringing up bad vibes.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Whatever. Just leave me alone will ya? You're bumming me out. I don't even want to think about this stuff. It's bringing up bad vibes.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":9950.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46634","byteOffset":31974968,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_ECD685B1","articyId":"72057821671320093","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"We were gonna do big things during the LUZ. We were gonna play a huge concert and bring music and light and electricity into everyone's life!","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We were gonna do big things during the LUZ. We were gonna play a huge concert and bring music and light and electricity into everyone's life!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4225.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47804","byteOffset":32419792,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_BA00C2D9","articyId":"72057821671320110","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Fauxter Glambeat","text":"But it wasn't all good. Our manager stole all our money and our third album with the \"new sound\" - techno pan pipes - didn't find an audience.","speakerId":"Ntt_EA96D16B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But it wasn't all good. Our manager stole all our money and our third album with the \"new sound\" - techno pan pipes - didn't find an audience.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":7550.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44877","byteOffset":31311936,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_40683CB6","articyId":"72057774426558667","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Tricks are good.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Tricks are good.","TextSheVersion":"Tricks are good.","TextTheyVersion":"Tricks are good."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":300.0,"y":-225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45685","byteOffset":31615464,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_8EB4ACB4","articyId":"72057774426558689","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"How are you Fauxter?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"locali